*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_SMOD_Power_Reset
    [Documentation]   Purpose of this test case is to test that BTS operates correctly after power reset procedure.
    ...               This case verifies if BTS site will be back to fully operational state after temporary power outage.
    ...               Statuses of all SMOD's, BBMODs, RMOD, Cells and OnAir state are checked during the test at the beginning
    ...               and after BTS site power reset. Ping status to BTS via local transport address is verified after power
    ...               outage and power restore.
    ...               For more information about TCs steps please navigate to:
    ...               General_SiSo_Auto_SMOD_Power_Reset in QC.
    ...       ARGS:
    ...       - called_cells_distnames: CONFIGURATION distnames of cells that will be called, if not given,
    ...                             list of all cells on testline will be determined and called
    ...       - throughputs: dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by it's nrCellIdentity.
    ...                      Example:
    ...                      {
    ...                          '827736065':
    ...                               {
    ...                                   'throughput':
    ...                                       {
    ...                                           'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                           'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                       },
    ...                                   'deviation': '90%'
    ...                               },
    ...                      }
    ...       - protocol: data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...       - udp_buffer: monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...       - tput_verification_via_btslog: True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                   False - throuput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False
    ...       - ue_network_modes: dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"}
    ...                                  possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                                  when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                  with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...                                  mandatory for SA+NSA setups, defaults to None
    ...       - ues_and_cells: dict with UE serial numbers and lists of configuration distnames of cells to which they
    ...                               can be attached e.g. {"SN1234": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-3"],
    ...                                                     "SN5678": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-5"]}
    ...                               defaults to ${None} which means that all UEs will be attached to all cells.
    ...                               when given, listed cells will be called in pairs with specified UEs, if there are more
    ...                               cells on the setup that were not mentioned in the list, they will be called with all UEs
    ...       - ignored_cells_on_preparation: SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                       list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                       L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred
    [Arguments]                       ${called_cells_distnames}=${None}
    ...                               ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...                               ${protocol}=UDP
    ...                               ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                               ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=False
    ...                               ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...                               ${ues_and_cells}=${None}
    ...                               ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}
    ${connection}                                      connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ${bts_type}                                        testline.get_type_of_setup

    Check Statuses of BTS Components before SMOD Power Reset
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Alarms.Allow X2 Link Alarms
    Alarms.Allow alarm                                 fault_name=No usable time reference available
    ...                                                fault_id=4405
    ...                                                bts_type=ENB

    Turn Off All SMODs                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            30s
    ...                                                10s
    ...                                                Check if SMODs are not reachable
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Turn On All SMODs                                  bts_type=${bts_type}

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            180s
    ...                                                20s
    ...                                                Check if SMODs are reachable
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Check Statuses of BTS Components after SMOD Power Reset
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

    Alarms.Disallow X2 Link Alarms
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                              fault_name=No usable time reference available
    ...                                                fault_id=4405
    ...                                                bts_type=ENB

    run keyword if                                     ${throughputs}
    ...                                                Execute L3 call
    ...                                                cells_distnames=${called_cells_distnames}
    ...                                                throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                                ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                                ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                                ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    [Teardown]        power.turn_on_all_gnb_smods


Turn Off All SMODs
    [Arguments]    ${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                Power off all ${bts_type} SMODs

    Run Keyword If        '${bts_type}'=='GNB'         power.turn_off_all_gnb_smods
    ...                                                ELSE
    ...                                                power.turn_off_all_enb_smods

Turn On All SMODs
    [Arguments]    ${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                Power on all ${bts_type} SMODs

    Run Keyword If        '${bts_type}'=='GNB'         power.turn_on_all_gnb_smods
    ...                                                ELSE
    ...                                                power.turn_on_all_enb_smods

Check if SMODs are reachable
    [Arguments]    ${bts_type}
    ...            ${timeout}=5

    @{smods_ips}                                       testline.get_smods_ip_addresses
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Operation                                Checking if ${bts_type} SMODs are reachable...

    FOR  ${smod_ip}  IN  @{smods_ips}
        ${is_reachable}                                connections.wait_for_desired_site_state
        ...                                            url=https://${smod_ip}
        ...                                            timeout=${timeout}
        ...                                            should_be_reachable=${True}
        Should be equal            ${is_reachable}     ${True}
        Robot Log Result                               ${smod_ip} is reachable
    END

Check if SMODs are not reachable
    [Arguments]    ${bts_type}
    ...            ${timeout}=5

    @{smods_ips}                                       testline.get_smods_ip_addresses
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
    Robot Log Operation                                Checking if ${bts_type} SMODs are not reachable...

    FOR  ${smod_ip}  IN  @{smods_ips}
        ${is_unreachable}                               connections.wait_for_desired_site_state
        ...                                             url=https://${smod_ip}
        ...                                             timeout=${timeout}
        ...                                             should_be_reachable=${False}
        Should be equal            ${is_unreachable}    ${True}
        Robot Log Result                                ${smod_ip} is not reachable
    END

Check Statuses of BTS Components before SMOD Power Reset
    [Arguments]    ${connection}
    ...            ${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                Verifying SMODs online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            10s
    ...                                                5s
    ...                                                status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_smods
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                status_variant=online
    Robot Log Result                                   SMODs statuses validation finished successfully.

    Robot Log Operation                                Verifying BBMODs online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            10s
    ...                                                5s
    ...                                                status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_bbmods
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                status_variant=online
    Robot Log Result                                   BBMODs statuses validation finished successfully.

    Robot Log Operation                                Verifying RMODs online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            10s
    ...                                                5s
    ...                                                status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_rmods
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                status_variant=online
    Robot Log Result                                   RMODs statuses validation finished successfully.

    Robot Log Operation                                Verifying Cells online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            10s
    ...                                                5s
    ...                                                Check statuses of all cells
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                status_variant=online

    Robot Log Operation                                Verifying BTS OnAir state...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            10s
    ...                                                5s
    ...                                                Verify BTS states
    ...                                                status=OnAir
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}

Check Statuses of BTS Components after SMOD Power Reset
    [Arguments]    ${connection}
    ...            ${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                Waiting for SMODs online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            15min
    ...                                                10s
    ...                                                status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_smods
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                status_variant=online
    Robot Log Result                                   SMODs statuses validation finished successfully.

    Robot Log Operation                                Waiting for BBMODs online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            5min
    ...                                                10s
    ...                                                status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_bbmods
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                status_variant=online
    Robot Log Result                                   BBMODs statuses validation finished successfully.

    Robot Log Operation                                Waiting for RMODs online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            5min
    ...                                                10s
    ...                                                status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_rmods
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                status_variant=online
    Robot Log Result                                   RMODs statuses validation finished successfully.

    Robot Log Operation                                Waiting for Cells online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            5min
    ...                                                5s
    ...                                                Check statuses of all cells
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                status_variant=online

    Robot Log Operation                                Waiting for BTS OnAir state...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer            10min
    ...                                                5s
    ...                                                Verify BTS states
    ...                                                status=OnAir
    ...                                                bts_type=${bts_type}
